'''Estate agents''' are memebers of the Gielinor Housing Agency that sell [[player]]s land to build [[player-owned house]]s (POH) on, as well as decorating them and/or moving them. These agents can be found in several major cities: [[Varrock]], [[Falador]], [[Seers' Village]], [[East Ardougne]], [[Hosidius]], and [[Varlamore]] as well as [[Alwyn]] taking up the role in the Ithell district of [[Prifddinas]]. They are identified on the [[minimap]] by a symbol of a small house ([[File:Estate Agent icon.png]]). 

Players may either pay 1,000 [[coins]] or complete the quest [[Daddy's Home]] to get their first house in [[Rimmington]]. With ownership of a house, players are able to claim [[Construction guide|construction guides]] for free and start training the [[Construction]] skill.

Estate agents also sell the [[Construct. cape|Construction cape]] for 99,000 coins to anyone with level 99 in Construction.

